{"2980870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Mage Slayer", "steam_appid": 2980870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mage Slayer is a fast-paced third-person hack-and-slash action game about defeating powerful mages without using magic yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elysianna, magic defines human worth. Those born without it are treated as less than human. You play as Krad — a man with no innate magic, cast to the bottom of society, yet trained through discipline, swordsmanship, and sheer will to stand against those born with overwhelming power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master stylish melee combat, exploit elemental weaknesses, switch between weapons, and uncover the truth behind a decaying world ruled by corruption, class prejudice, and false divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful mages in intense melee encounters built around timing, movement, weapon mastery, and aggressive combo expression. Krad has no magic to rely on - only speed, precision, and the ability to turn enemy power against them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER FAST-PACED THIRD-PERSON COMBAT</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/29ba1417e1cab091ce0e9277943c7cbf.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/29ba1417e1cab091ce0e9277943c7cbf.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/29ba1417e1cab091ce0e9277943c7cbf.mp4?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SWITCH BETWEEN MULTIPLE WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different weapons to adapt to different enemy types, defenses, and combat situations. Chain attacks, extend combos, and find the fighting style that lets you break through overwhelming magical force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/0504ff1c5f4632762d2910a0ea4d6c74.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/0504ff1c5f4632762d2910a0ea4d6c74.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/0504ff1c5f4632762d2910a0ea4d6c74.mp4?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COUNTER ELEMENTAL MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental power is not just visual flair — it is part of combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earth Type Weapon Counters Water Shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/8e7a254ea320aad12ceeef4399157c74.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/8e7a254ea320aad12ceeef4399157c74.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/8e7a254ea320aad12ceeef4399157c74.mp4?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Absorb Fire to Break Metal Armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/aa300ee092568e3c346411ee04aa83a5.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/aa300ee092568e3c346411ee04aa83a5.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/aa300ee092568e3c346411ee04aa83a5.mp4?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Parry Fire Magic to Unleash Fire Palm Strike<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/89842d0f230d0ca217655f5ace3eb84c.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/89842d0f230d0ca217655f5ace3eb84c.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/89842d0f230d0ca217655f5ace3eb84c.mp4?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must understand how each element interacts with the battlefield, your weapons, and your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES THROUGH ELEMENTAL INTERACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use Flamethrower to Break Metal Magic Obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/d8150cf1367717ed1106dabc9e2