ragraph\" >As Krad’s strength grows, so does his understanding of the world’s greatest secret - and the role he may play in its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn this rotten world to the ground, and decide what, if anything, deserves to rise from its ashes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mage Slayer is a fast-paced third-person hack-and-slash action game about defeating powerful mages without using magic yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elysianna, magic defines human worth. Those born without it are treated as less than human. You play as Krad — a man with no innate magic, cast to the bottom of society, yet trained through discipline, swordsmanship, and sheer will to stand against those born with overwhelming power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master stylish melee combat, exploit elemental weaknesses, switch between weapons, and uncover the truth behind a decaying world ruled by corruption, class prejudice, and false divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful mages in intense melee encounters built around timing, movement, weapon mastery, and aggressive combo expression. Krad has no magic to rely on - only speed, precision, and the ability to turn enemy power against them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER FAST-PACED THIRD-PERSON COMBAT</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/29ba1417e1cab091ce0e9277943c7cbf.poster.avif?t=1779503113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980870/extras/29ba1417e1cab091ce0e9277943c7cbf.webm?t=1779503113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: